Fixes legacy defect L-01: the TopLevelRuntime lowering moved every main-module line, including the ON ERROR handler label, into SUB QBNEX_TOPLEVEL_RUNTIME0, so the legacy compiler failed with "Unknown statement 'END'" past the last line. Main-module code before the first SUB/FUNCTION now stays in the main module. Expected output is the QBasic result (runtime quirks such as MBF overflow error 5 are unchanged legacy behaviour).
